ZWV0OjIxMjU1NzUyMzcwNzcxODA0MTc=","text":"令和８年１１月２５日（水）午後、中国軍の情報収集機（Ｙ－９）×１機が大陸方面から飛来し、東シナ海上の長崎県男女群島沖の南方まで飛行した後、反転し、大陸方面に向けて飛行したことを確認した。\nまた、同日午後、中国軍の偵察／攻撃型無人機（ＴＢ－００１）×１機が大陸方面から飛来し、長崎県男女群島沖で変針し、大陸方面に飛行したことを確認した。\nこれに対し、航空自衛隊の南西航空方面隊等の戦闘機を緊急発進させ対応した。"}}},"rest_id":"2125575237127548986","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"48071","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"rest_id":"2125575786820493498","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"52801","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2125575786820493498","sortIndex":"2125817755226603492"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":2},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1082102533454102528/HXpr1ZEl_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/303730149/1791191305"},"core":{"created_at":"Mon May 23 10:17:04 +0000 2011","name":"外務省","screen_name":"MofaJapan_jp"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjozMDM3MzAxNDk=","is_blue_verified":false,"location":{"location":"東京都千代田区"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{"tweet_ids_str":["2123372392798142557"]},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"外務省の公式アカウントです。外交に関する新着情報を中心に発信しております。｜英語版（English）@MofaJapan_en\n｜外務省ソーシャルメディア一覧： https://t.co/2VDfT2CQ5p","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mofa.go.jp/mofaj/annai/sn…","exp