いて意見交換が行われました。 https://t.co/LP9cxpVCw2","id_str":"2125525516270883064","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":11,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"303730149"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"mofa.go.jp/mofaj/pr_pd/mc…","expanded_url":"https://www.mofa.go.jp/mofaj/pr_pd/mcc/pageit_000001_03351.html","indices":[199,222],"url":"https://t.co/0S1ymlK1gh"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMjU1MjU1MTYxNDUwOTQ2NTY=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"堀井外務副大臣は、新潟県（新潟市及び佐渡市）を訪問し、花角英世新潟県知事及び渡辺竜五佐渡市長とそれぞれ意見交換を行いました。新潟県及び佐渡市との間では、世界遺産の佐渡島の金山をはじめとした地元の魅力の海外への発信等について意見交換が行われました。\nまた、佐渡市において、中野洸・佐渡島の金山を未来につなぐ会会長との間で、佐渡島の金山に関する同会長のこれまでの取組等について意見交換を行いました。\n\nhttps://t.co/0S1ymlK1gh"}}},"rest_id":"2125525516270883064","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"5633","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2125525516270883064","sortIndex":"2125817755226603484"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":2},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1082102533454102528/HXpr1ZEl_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/303730149/1791191305"},"core":{"created_at":"Mon May 23 10:17:04 +0000 2011","name":"外務省","screen_name":"MofaJapan_jp"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"